@startuml
title Diagramme de contexte systeme - CanTelcoX Phase 1

top to bottom direction

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #334155
}
skinparam actor {
  BorderColor #334155
}
skinparam ArrowColor #334155

' =========================
' ACTEURS / PARTIES PRENANTES
' =========================
together {
  actor "Abonne particulier\n/ representant PME" as Subscriber
  actor "Agent back-office\nCanTelcoX" as Agent
  actor "Equipe securite\n/ conformite" as Security
  actor "Regulateur /\nauditeur\nCRTC / Loi 25" as Regulator
  actor "Equipe exploitation\n/ DevOps-SRE" as Ops
}

' =========================
' SYSTEME
' =========================
rectangle "<<system>>\nCanTelcoX\nPlateforme commerciale BSS" as BSS #EAF2FF

' =========================
' SYSTEMES EXTERNES / OUTILS DE DEMO
' =========================
together {
  rectangle "<<external>>\nReseau mobile simule\nHLR / HSS / UDM\nfree5GC ou mock" as Hlr
  rectangle "<<external>>\nHub de portabilite\nMSISDN simule" as Portability
  rectangle "<<external>>\nPasserelle de paiement\nsimulee" as Payment
  rectangle "<<external>>\nMediation d'usage\nCDR / usage demo" as Mediation
  rectangle "<<external>>\nService OTP / MFA\nsimule Phase 1" as Mfa
  rectangle "<<external>>\nService KYC / scoring\nsimule Phase 1" as Kyc
  rectangle "<<external>>\nObservabilite\nPrometheus / Grafana" as Observability
}

' =========================
' Liens invisibles pour forcer la structure
' =========================
Subscriber -[hidden]down-> BSS
Agent -[hidden]down-> BSS
Security -[hidden]down-> BSS
Regulator -[hidden]down-> BSS
Ops -[hidden]down-> BSS

BSS -[hidden]down-> Hlr
BSS -[hidden]down-> Portability
BSS -[hidden]down-> Payment
BSS -[hidden]down-> Mediation
BSS -[hidden]down-> Mfa
BSS -[hidden]down-> Kyc
BSS -[hidden]down-> Observability

' =========================
' Acteurs vers CanTelcoX
' =========================
Subscriber --> BSS : HTTPS/JSON\ninscription, MFA,\noffres, commandes,\nactivation, consultation,\npaiement
BSS --> Subscriber : HTTPS/JSON\nconfirmations, statuts,\nfactures, notifications\nsimulees

Agent --> BSS : HTTPS/JSON\nsupport client,\nactivation,\nconsultation client
BSS --> Agent : HTTPS/JSON\nrapports operationnels,\nerreurs, statuts

Security --> BSS : regles anti-fraude,\ncontroles SIM swap,\nconsultation traces
BSS --> Security : alertes risque,\ntraces auditables

Regulator --> BSS : exigences reglementaires,\ndemandes de preuves
BSS --> Regulator : rapports de conformite,\njournaux d'audit

Ops --> BSS : exploitation,\ndeploiement,\nhealthchecks
BSS --> Ops : etats de service,\nlogs, metriques

' =========================
' CanTelcoX vers systemes externes
' =========================
BSS --> Hlr : REST/JSON\nprovisioning ligne,\nactivation SIM/eSIM
BSS --> Portability : REST/JSON\ndemande de portabilite\nsimplifiee
BSS --> Payment : REST/JSON\nautorisation / capture\npaiement facture
BSS --> Mediation : REST/JSON ou batch\nCDR voix/SMS/data\nsimules
BSS --> Mfa : REST/JSON\ngeneration / validation\nOTP-MFA
BSS --> Kyc : REST/JSON\nverification identite,\nscore de risque
BSS --> Observability : metriques,\nhealthchecks,\ndashboards

note bottom of BSS
Vue contexte: CanTelcoX est volontairement represente comme une boite noire.
Les services internes, bounded contexts et schemas de donnees sont detailles
dans les vues logique, developpement, persistance et deploiement.
end note

@enduml
